{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dommasandra","position":0,"fetched_on":"2026-09-06","title":"Dommasandra","locality":"Dommasandra","chroma:document":"Dommasandra is a village in the southern state of Karnataka, India. It is located in the Anekal Taluk of Bangalore Urban district in Karnataka. As of 2015 India census, Dommasandra had a population of 10,000 with 5,000 males and 5,000 females."